In an accordion, Esc selects the level above, one at a time: a block of a panel, its panel, the accordion, then the page, where the settings say how to choose a level. The breadcrumbs start at the page too. A click on the accordion's frame selects it, and deleting a panel selects its accordion. A block of a panel selected with Esc is deleted with Delete or Backspace, with an Undo notification, and Esc from the text of a block no longer selects the whole accordion. @Humanaice
